-- Renumber the mounts ported from 4Classic (010) so they follow our own sequences
-- (Tools/ClassicPort `merge` — generated, do not edit by hand):
--   mounts   40… -> 40-49, 55-123   (50-54 are hardcoded in the client)
--   monsters -> 31880-31965   (after 31879, Polar Battle Bear)
--   items    -> 31324-31411   (after 31323, Hopping Cow)
-- Old and new mount ranges overlap, so mount ids go through old+10000 first.
-- Runs only while the old ids are still present (idempotent; no-op on an already renumbered DB).
-- NOTE: chart tables load once at startup - RESTART TMapSvr/TWorldSvr after applying.
USE [TGame_gsp];
GO

SET NOCOUNT ON;
SET XACT_ABORT ON;
